{"text": "We have come to dedicate a portion of that field as a final resting place for those who here gave their lives that this nation might live.", "paragraph": 2, "words": ["We", "have", "come", "to", "dedicate", "a", "portion", "of", "that", "field", "as", "a", "final", "resting", "place", "for", "those", "who", "here", "gave", "their", "lives", "that", "this", "nation", "might", "live", "."], "upos": ["PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "PART", "VERB", "DET", "NOUN", "ADP", "DET", "NOUN", "ADP", "DET", "ADJ", "NOUN", "NOUN", "ADP", "PRON", "PRON", "ADV", "VERB", "PRON", "NOUN", "SCONJ", "DET", "NOUN", "AUX", "VERB", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["PRP", "VBP", "VBN", "TO", "VB", "DT", "NN", "IN", "DT", "NN", "IN", "DT", "JJ", "NN", "NN", "IN", "DT", "WP", "RB", "VBD", "PRP$", "NNS", "IN", "DT", "NN", "MD", "VB", "."], "heads": [3, 3, 0, 5, 3, 7, 5, 10, 10, 7, 15, 15, 15, 15, 5, 17, 15, 20, 20, 17, 22, 20, 27, 25, 27, 27, 20, 3], "rels": ["nsubj", "aux", "root", "mark", "xcomp", "det", "obj", "case", "det", "nmod", "case", "det", "amod", "compound", "obl", "case", "nmod", "nsubj", "advmod", "acl:relcl", "nmod:poss", "iobj", "mark", "det", "nsubj", "aux", "ccomp", "punct"]},
